n't really realize the scale of  this problem I didn't realize that there  were two and a half million Australians  who have a really dangerous view of  their body image and thinking about it  to the point where everything else in  their life is taking a complete backseat  all of these new disorders are popping  up and we're not really keeping up with  it  [Music]

